From 5c6f7c2b5a5d65b9196f287406830db543d771ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lzc256 <i@lzc256.com>
Date: Mon, 29 Jun 2026 22:10:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(models): correct vendor lookup in Use Default button

The searchVendors API returns data with an 'items' array, not a direct array.
Fixed to access vendorRes.data.items[0].id instead of vendorRes.data[0].id.
---
 .../dialogs/missing-models-dialog.tsx         | 155 +++++++++++++++++-
 web/default/src/i18n/locales/en.json          |   4 +-
 web/default/src/i18n/locales/fr.json          |   4 +-
